# xref v1.0.0

## Forms

### `(node …)`

Named graph node. Referenced by `:edge`.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:id` | `symbol` | yes | — | Stable identifier within the document. |
| `:label` | `string` | no | — | — |
| `:parent` | `ref → (node :id …)` | no | — | — |

### `(phrase …)`

Composable phrase. Referenced by `:phrase-ref` (scope-form scoped to a parent `(piece …)`).

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |
| `:body` | `string` | no | — | — |

### `(piece …)`

Scope-form root for nested `(phrase …)` registries.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:title` | `string` | yes | — | — |

Positional children: any.

### `(shader …)`

Opaque source blob. Its `:code` string is the member set for `:uniform-ref`, read by the `uniforms` provider.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |
| `:code` | `string` | yes | — | — |

### `(render-pipeline …)`

A raster pipeline. One half of the ambiguous pair.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

### `(compute-pipeline …)`

A compute pipeline. The other half.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

### `(edge …)`

Directed edge between two `(node …)` declarations.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:from` | `ref → (node :id …)` | yes | — | — |
| `:to` | `ref → (node :id …)` | yes | — | — |
| `:phrase` | `ref → (phrase :name …)` | no | — | — |
| `:uniform` | `ref → (shader :code via uniforms)` | no | — | — |
| `:pipeline` | `render-pipeline-ref \| compute-pipeline-ref` | no | — | — |
| `:group-pipeline` | `ref → (render-pipeline | compute-pipeline :name …)` | no | — | — |

## Value kinds

### node-ref

Cross-ref to a `(node …)` declared elsewhere.

Type: `ref → (node :id …)`.

### node-acyclic

Acyclic cross-ref to a `(node …)`.

Type: `ref → (node :id …)`.

### phrase-ref

Cross-ref to a `(phrase …)` declared within the enclosing `(piece …)`.

Type: `ref → (phrase :name …)`.

### uniform-ref

Cross-ref to a uniform declared inside some `(shader …)`'s source.

Type: `ref → (shader :code via uniforms)`.

### render-pipeline-ref

Cross-ref to a `(render-pipeline …)`.

Type: `ref → (render-pipeline :name …)`.

### compute-pipeline-ref

Cross-ref to a `(compute-pipeline …)`.

Type: `ref → (compute-pipeline :name …)`.

### pipeline-ref

Either pipeline. Tried in this order — render first.

Type: `render-pipeline-ref | compute-pipeline-ref`.

### pipeline-group-ref

Either pipeline, in one namespace — a name defined by both is a duplicate.

Type: `ref → (render-pipeline | compute-pipeline :name …)`.
